{
 "header": [
  "The page's extended plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, about 290 s from the launcher to its last step,",
  "three tracks in one visit: the regular plan's way in (tools/play_plan.json says it) to a Single Race on Coventry",
  "Cove, driven as that plan drives it (the steer assist, the gas, backing out of a fence) for 35 s of the race's clock",
  "from its load, its flyover and countdown included; then Start, the pause menu's New Track and Are You Sure?'s Yes",
  "(Down twice, A, Up, A), which goes straight to Track Select, its cursor on the track just raced. A new save's Track",
  "Select offers two tracks, so before the pause the plan writes 6 to gNumOpenTracks, the count a save that has won the",
  "championships keeps (tools/game_state.js), and Track Select offers all six. Two Rights there are Inferno Isle",
  "(track 9), A through Car Select and Transmission to its race; then the same to Metro Madness (track 10), two Rights",
  "on from Inferno Isle. That Track Select moves no currentTrack until a track is chosen, so each race is a need that",
  "the game is racing on the track asked for. Each is driven 40 s of the race's clock with the steer assist and the",
  "gas, with no backing out (the car's speed is known on Coventry Cove only). A shot at each pause, Are You Sure?,",
  "Track Select and 15 s into each race, and at each race's end. Mount Mayhem, the other track a new save offers, is",
  "tools/shader_plan.json's."
